        "The active arm pose target is not intentionally changed by this call.",
        "Gripper commands remain within the public actuator limits."
      ],
      "failure_behavior": "Stop changing the gripper command and return a bounded capability error if the requested aperture cannot be established within the declared duration or public limits.",
      "criteria": [
